# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# DB-002: the leaf menu's rows carry real art -- a folder beside /sys,
# painted by the shell through the injected painter.  The row sits below
# the application groups, and the art moves down with them.
wait 12
click 980 20
wait 3
expect-pixel 701 197 fac468
note and the rows that expand carry art of their own
expect-pixel 701 134 fac468
note and so do the rows inside them: what configures the bar, and what
note configures Tracker, each beside its own picture
menu-pick Settings
wait 5
expect-pixel 492 108 f8c874
expect-pixel 492 129 f8c874
quit
